   "en": "The <魔装機神> Granveil...@You've got nerve, marching right in here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "jp": "「命が惜しければ、直ちに国外へ去れ。@　生半な覚悟とそのような<魔装機>で、@　僕に勝つことは出来ないぞ」",
   "en": "If you value your life, leave this country now.@With such half-hearted resolve and a <魔装機>@like that, you'll never defeat me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "jp": "「敗軍の兵が何を言う！@　お前達がどうあがいた所で、@　我が軍は圧倒的に優勢なのだ！」",
   "en": "Big words from a beaten army!@No matter how you struggle,@our forces hold the overwhelming advantage!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "jp": "「ふん……そう感情的になっては、@　魔装機の扱いはおぼつかんぞ」",
   "en": "Hmph... Let your emotions run wild like that,@and you'll never handle a Masouki properly.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "jp": "「傲岸不遜なその物言い、許せん！@　お前の魔装機神をろ獲し、ジェスハ将軍に@　献上してくれる！」",
   "en": "Such arrogant insolence! I won't stand for it!@I'll capture your Masoukishin and present it@to General Jesuha!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "jp": "「不相応の欲は、己の目を曇らせると知れ」",
   "en": "Know that undeserved greed clouds one's eyes.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "jp": "「減らず口を叩くな！　各機、攻撃開始！@　奴らを基地へ行かせるな！」",
   "en": "Enough of your lip! All units, attack!@Don't let them reach the base!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "jp": "「リューネ、敵陣へ突入するぞ。遅れるな！」",
   "en": "Lüne, we're charging the enemy lines. Keep up!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "jp": "「それはこっちの台詞だよ！」",
   "en": "That's my line!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "jp": "「ご主人様、こちらへ接近してくる機体が……@　数は１、魔装機ではないようです」",
   "en": "Master, a unit is approaching us...@Just one. It doesn't appear to be a Masouki.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "jp": "「なら、地上の機動兵器か？」",
   "en": "Then a mobile weapon from the surface?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "jp": "「あっ、この反応は……！」",
   "en": "Ah, that signal is...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "jp": "「やはり、ヴァルシオーネか。@　もう１機は……何だ？」",
   "en": "The Valsione, as I thought.@And the other one... what is that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "jp": "「キョウスケ！@　あんたもラ・ギアスへ召喚されてたの？」",
   "en": "Kyosuke!@Were you summoned to La Gias too?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "jp": "「<ラ・ギアス>……？@　マサキが言っていた地底世界か？」",
   "en": "<ラ・ギアス>...?@The underground world Masaki talked about?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "jp": "「そうだよ」",
   "en": "Yep.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "jp": "「……ダイレクトに転移したわけではなかったか。@　ならば、あの二人も……」",
   "en": "...So it wasn't a direct transfer after all.@Then those two may also be...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "jp": "「え？　何の話？」",
   "en": "Huh? What're you talking about?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "jp": "「いや、気にするな。@　……こちらは状況がよくわかっていない。@　お前と共に戦っている機体は何だ？」",
   "en": "Never mind.@...I don't fully understand the situation here.@What's that unit fighting alongside you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "jp": "「あれは魔装機神グランヴェール……@　乗ってるのは、ホワン・ヤンロン。@　こっち側でのマサキの仲間だよ」",
   "en": "That's the Masoukishin Granveil...@Its pilot's Huang Yang Long.@He's Masaki's comrade down here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "jp": "「彼は何者だ、リューネ？」",
   "en": "Who is he, Lüne?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "jp": "「地球連邦軍のキョウスケ・ナンブ中尉……@　地上での仲間だよ。マサキとも知り合いだし」",
   "en": "Lieutenant Kyosuke Nanbu of the Earth@Federation Army... A friend from the surface.@He knows Masaki, too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "jp": "「詳しい事情を聞くためには、@　ここでの戦闘を終わらせる必要がありそうだな」",
   "en": "Looks like I'll need to end this battle@before I can hear the details.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "jp": "「そういうこと。悪いけど、手伝ってくんない？」",
   "en": "Exactly. Sorry, but could you give us a hand?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "jp": "「了解した」",
   "en": "Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "jp": "「くうっ、よくも！　この屈辱、忘れんぞ！！」",
   "en": "Ngh, damn you! I won't forget this humiliation!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "jp": "「ご主人様、敵機の反応が全て消えました」",
   "en": "Master, all enemy signals have vanished.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "jp": "「これでひとまずの任務は果たせた。@　リューネ、キョウスケ中尉、礼を言う」",
   "en": "That fulfills our mission for now.@Lüne, Lieutenant Kyosuke, you have my thanks.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "jp": "「どう致しまして」",
   "en": "You're welcome.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "jp": "「……早速だが、事情を説明して欲しい」",
   "en": "...I'd like an explanation, right away.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "jp": "「そうだね……あんたの話も聞きたいし」",
   "en": "Sure... I want to hear your side, too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "jp": "「じゃあ、鋼龍戦隊とは別行動だったんだ……」",
   "en": "So you were separate from the Steel Dragons...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "jp": "「詳しくは話せんが、おれとマサキ、@　リュウセイで行動していて、その後で転移……@　いや、召喚されてしまったようだ」",
   "en": "I can't go into detail, but I was working with@Masaki and Ryusei. Then we were transferred...@no, it seems we were summoned.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "jp": "「珍しいね、その三人で動いてたなんて。@　じゃ、リュウセイもラ・ギアスに来てるかもね」",
   "en": "That's rare, you three working together.@Then maybe Ryusei's in La Gias too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "jp": "「奴だけじゃない。@　ゲートがそこかしこで開かれているなら……@　鋼龍戦隊の面々も召喚されている可能性がある」",
   "en": "Not just him.@If gates are opening all over the place...@the Steel Dragons may have been summoned too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "jp": "「実は……あたしもそんな気がしてたんだ」",
   "en": "Actually... I kinda had that feeling too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "jp": "「ともかく、情報を集めんとな」",
   "en": "Either way, we need to gather information.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "jp": "「うん……いきなりラ・ギアスへ呼び込まれて、@　困ってる仲間がいるかも知れないしね」",
   "en": "Yeah... Some of our friends might've been@dragged into La Gias out of nowhere@and could be in trouble.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "jp": "「……僕達の陣営につくことを勧めるが、@　強制をするつもりはない。リスクがあるからな」",
   "en": "...I'd recommend joining our side,@but I won't force you. There are risks.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "jp": "「って言われても、行く当てがないしねえ……」",
   "en": "Not like I've got anywhere else to go, though...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "jp": "「ホワン・ヤンロン……だったな。@　召喚された地上人の情報が集まるまで、@　同行させてもらう」",
   "en": "Huang Yang Long, was it?@Until I learn more about the summoned surfacers,@I'll travel with you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "jp": "「僕と行動を共にする以上、@　シュテドニアス軍との戦闘は避けられんぞ」",
   "en": "As long as you're with me,@fighting the Schtedonias Army is unavoidable.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "jp": "「わかっている。@　おれもこの地で果てるつもりはないからな」",
   "en": "I know.@I have no intention of dying here, either.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "jp": "「グランヴェールと言えど、@　先手を取れば勝機が見えるはずだ！」",
   "en": "Granveil or not, if I strike first,@I should have a shot at winning!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "jp": "「例え、機先を制したとしても、@　僕を倒すことは出来ないぞ！」",
   "en": "Even if you seize the initiative,@you won't be able to defeat me!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "jp": "「何だ、その機体は！@　そうまでして、人の姿に……しかも、@　女に似せる意味と必要性があるのか！？」",
   "en": "What is that machine?! Why go so far as to@give it a human form... and a woman's, no less?!@What's the point? What's the need?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "jp": "「あたしのヴァルシオーネを馬鹿にしたら、@　許さないよ！」",
   "en": "Make fun of my Valsione,@and you'll regret it!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  }
 ]
}